{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_40","type":"agent_message","text":"The rendering problem also occurred in a minimal Three.js scene; adding an ANGLE backend flag made native WebGPU run without errors on this machine. Visual checks confirm the ink-styled ships, planets, station, and cockpit. End-to-end tests also found menu-to-flight mouse drift and a controller map-confirm issue; those are fixed. I’m now checking multiplayer conformance and final campaign edge cases.\n"}}
